hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"434","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman yani Ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn se, Abu Malik se: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas Hazrat Hamzah ko laya gaya aur nau afrad ko laya gaya, to Aap ne un par namaz parhi, mukammal hadith jaisa ke pehle guzar chuki hai."
"435","Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas se, Ata se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Hamzah par namaz parhi, hadith jaisa ke thori der pehle guzar chuki hai."
